    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for accessing and interacting with Visio files stored in SharePoint Online and OneDrive for Business through Microsoft Graph. Provides operations for reading pages, shapes, shape data, comments, and hyperlinks from Visio diagrams.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Microsoft Graph Support",
